  "prefLabel": "Cor 212.02 Mandatory Pre-Hearing Disclosure of Witnesses and Exhibits",
  "priorExpiration": "2009-08-03",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Cor 212.02 Mandatory Pre-Hearing Disclosure of Witnesses and Exhibits. At least 5 days before the hearing the parties shall exchange a list of all witnesses to be called at the hearing with a brief summary of their testimony, a list of all documents or exhibits to be offered as evidence at the hearing, and a copy of each document or exhibit.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Cor 200) #7447, eff 2-6-01; ss by #9382, INTERIM, eff 2-3-09, EXPIRES: 8-3-09; ss by #9507-A, eff 7-8-09 (from Cor 210.02); ss by #12501, eff 3-23-18",
